---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro'
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro'
import Sponsor from '../components/Sponsor.astro'

const title = '赞助'
---

<Layout title={title}>
  <PageHeader title={title} subtitle="感谢每一份支持。" />

  <div class="sponsor-page">
    <Sponsor showLink={false} />

    <div class="sponsor-note">
      <p>赞助完全自愿，不影响本站内容的正常更新与访问。</p>
      <p>如果二维码无法识别，可以直接通过邮件联系我。</p>
      <p>
        邮箱：<a href="mailto:Yaten-Z@outlook.com">Yaten-Z@outlook.com</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .sponsor-page {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    padding: 1rem 0 2rem;
  }

  .sponsor-note {
    color: var(--text-description-color);
    font-size: var(--text-description-fontsize);
    line-height: 1.9;
  }

  .sponsor-note p {
    margin: 0.35rem 0;
  }

  .sponsor-note a {
    color: var(--text-content-color);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
  }

  .sponsor-note a:hover {
    background-color: var(--text-content-color);
    color: var(--bg-color);
  }
</style>
